<body style="margin:0px 0px 0px 0px;overflow:auto;background:#FFFFFF;">
<table style="font-family:Arial,Verdana,Times;font-size:12px;text-align:left;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;padding:3px 3px 3px 3px">
<tr style="text-align:center;font-weight:bold;background:#9CBCE2">
<td>Anzac Park All Abilities Playground</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>
<table style="font-family:Arial,Verdana,Times;font-size:12px;text-align:left;width:100%;border-spacing:0px; padding:3px 3px 3px 3px">
<tr>
<td>FID</td>
<td>0</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Name</td>
<td>Anzac Park All Abilities Playground</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Address1</td>
<td>Macmillan Street</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Address2</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Suburb</td>
<td>Ayr</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Postcode</td>
<td>4807</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Playground</td>
<td>Interactive music elements, climbing net, bird's nest swing, garden see-saw, play structure with slide, sensory plants, wheelchair-accessible Sway Fun rocker</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Facilities</td>
<td>Picnic shelter with a barbecue, automated unisex toilet, drinking fountain, bench and platform seating, bike stands and soft-fall rubberised surfacing throughout</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Weblink</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image1</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/ayr-flags</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image1Desc</td>
<td>Established gardens, including large trees, provide shade and opportunities for children to enjoy and explore nature</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image2</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/ayr-equipment</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image2Desc</td>
<td>A variety of play equipment ensures children of all abilities have a fun and inclusive play experience</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image3</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/ayr-drive</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image3Desc</td>
<td>Driving can be so much fun!</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image4</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/ayr-facepaint</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image4Desc</td>
<td>Face painting was one of the attractions and part of the fun on the opening day</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Contact</td>
<td>Burdekin Shire Council on (07) 4783 9800</td>
</tr>
<tr>
