<td>4717</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Playground</td>
<td>Wheelchair-accessible Liberty Swing, flat-base swing and swing with a high-back seat and harness, sand and water play area featuring a dry creek bed, sand table and water spray, double flying fox, wheelchair-accessible carousel, natural logs and beams fo</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Facilities</td>
<td>Large picnic shelter with accessible barbecues and picnic tables, toilet and change facility, perimeter fencing, shade trees, and car and bus parking</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Weblink</td>
<td></td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image1</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/blackwater-view</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image1Desc</td>
<td>A range of different textures including sand makes for a fun play experience</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image2</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/blackwater-swings</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image2Desc</td>
<td>A range of swings available for children of all abilities and ages</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image3</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/blackwater-carousel</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image3Desc</td>
<td>Blue sky and sunny weather makes for great opening day celebrations</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image4</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/blackwater-libertyswing</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image4Desc</td>
<td>Using the Liberty Swing at opening day celebrations</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Contact</td>
<td>Central Highlands Regional Council on 1300 242 686</td>
</tr>
<tr>
