</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Postcode</td>
<td>4218</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Playground</td>
<td>Sway Fun, bucket spinner, carousel swing with harnesses and a rocker (Undersea zone), accessible sandcastle with turret, sand tables at various heights and a slide, sound tubes and stepping blocks (Sandcastle zone), hill slides, basket swing, flying fox,</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Facilities</td>
<td>Accessible car parking bays, bus drop-off zone, rubber and artificial turf surfacing, perimeter fencing and informal seating, amenities block featuring a change room with a hoist and adjustable table. Access to the change room is restricted. Contact coun</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Weblink</td>
<td><a target="_blank" href="http://gcparks.com.au/parks.aspx?page=353">http://gcparks.com.au/parks.aspx?page=353</a></td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image1</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/kurrawa-maze</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image1Desc</td>
<td>A wheelchair-accessible maze, featuring sea-inspired images etched into panels</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image2</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/kurrawa-sway-fun-empty</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image2Desc</td>
<td>Resembling a boat, a Sway Fun has a rocking-gliding action and caters for all with bench seating and space for two wheelchairs at the same time</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image3</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/kurrawa-carousel-harness</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image3Desc</td>
<td>A carousel with harnesses</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Image4</td>
<td>/disability/assets/images/children-young-people/all-abilities-playgrounds/kurrawa-carousel-swing</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Image4Desc</td>
<td>Having fun on the carousel swing</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Contact</td>
<td>Gold Coast City Council on (07) 5581 6984</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Latitude</td>
<td>-28.030208</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
