</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Postcode</td>
<td>4157</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Playground</td>
<td>Forts with ramp bridges, sand play area, swings, flying fox, rockers, climbing net, wheelchair-accessible Liberty Swing, chat boards, musical forest, natural plants, mounds and hilly areas, fitness equipment</td>
</tr>
<tr bgcolor="#D4E4F3">
<td>Facilities</td>
<td>Electric barbeques, wheelchair accessible toilets, shelters, bench seating, shade trees, dog off-leash area, wide access bicycle and walking paths, car park</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Weblink</td>
<td><a target="_blank" href="http://www.redland.qld.gov.au/RecreationFacilities/Parks/Pages/ParksDisabledFacilities.aspx">http://www.redland.qld.gov.au/RecreationFacilities/Parks/Pages/ParksDisabledFacilities.aspx</a></td>
</tr>
